                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "He gave a <w>hesitant</w> smile, unsure of how to answer the question.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "他露出了一个<w>迟疑的</w>微笑，不知道该如何回答这个问题。"
                            }
